(19, 'Event template', 'KorWHITEPM.png', NULL, '2027-01-06', '2026-07-10', NULL, NULL, 'Dublin, Irlanda', '53.3498053', '-6.2603097', NULL, '58-59, Vicar Street, Thomas St, The Liberties, Dublin 8, Irlanda', '53.34267639999999', '-6.2778366', '• Our bus will leave Dublin around [time] on [day morning/night].\r\n• Meeting point: 58–59 Thomas St, The Liberties, Dublin 8.\r\n• Bus returns to Dublin (Vicar St) to the same meeting point as soon as the shift ends (TBC).', 'Bar Staff', 1, 1, 15.40, '[enter the official event page or the ticket sales page, copy and paste the event description]', '<ul><li>The event is <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">outside Dublin</span>.</li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">€15.40/hour</span> (this is a <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">registered job)</span>.</li><li>You must be <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">available for all 3 days</span> of the festival.</li><li>We’ll be <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">camping on-site</span> for the weekend, you must bring your <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">own tent, mattress and sleeping bag</span>.</li><li>Shower facilities will be available in the <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">staff camping area</span>.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>We will all be working as part of the <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">bar team.</span></li><li>During the event, staff can be assigned to different bar positions, each supporting the service and helping the team run smoothly:<ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">Tills:</span> Operating the cash register, taking orders, charging customers, and keeping the queue moving smoothly</li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">Server:</span> Serving drinks to customers, keeping the area tidy, and helping with whatever is needed</li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">Pouring:</span> Pouring pints on the tap, ensuring good quality and serving efficiently</li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">MDU:</span> Using the Mobile Dispensing Unit, a portable tap system that pours pints much faster during busy events</li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">N/P:</span> Managing the serving of canned spirits, keeping stock organised, and ensuring fast service</li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">Runners:</span> Restocking cups, drinks, supporting the bar team, and ensuring nothing runs out</li></ul></li></ul>', '<p><span data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Shift information</span></p><ul><li>Your shift position will be informed <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">before the event</span>.</li><li>Your shift time will be displayed <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">at the top of this page</span>.</li><li>Follow all instructions from the <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">bar manager and supervisors</span>.</li><li>Stay in your assigned section unless instructed otherwise.</li><li>Keep communication clear and check the group for updates throughout the day.</li><li>And most importantly, <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">have fun! :D</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Check-in &amp; check-out<br></span></p><ul><li>You must <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">clock in and clock out at the exact time</span> of your assigned shift.</li><li>Any <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">overtime</span> must be <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">approved by the bar manager.</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Payment information</span><font color=\"#333b3f\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"></span></font></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">Rate of pay: €15.40 per hour</span>, and you will be paid for the number of hours of your working shift.</li><li>Payment will be processed <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">within two weeks</span> after the event.</li><li>Your <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">IBAN must be Irish</span> (such as AIB, BOI, PTSB, Revolut IE).</li><li>Ensure your bank details are correct to avoid delays.<br></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">App requirements<br></span></p><ul><li>Register your <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">bank details</span> and <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">PPS number</span> in the <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">Profile</span> section of the app.</li><li>This is an <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">availability enquiry only, </span>applying for an event does not confirm your spot.</li><li>After submitting your application, keep an eye on your <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">status</span>. If selected, it will update to “<span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">Confirmed”</span>.</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">What to wear</span></p><ul><li>Black top/jumper, black trousers and black shoes preferred. Choose <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">comfortable</span> clothing.</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Food &amp; break<br></span></p><h4></h4><p><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\"></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">You’re entitled to a paid break</span>, scheduled by the bar supervisor. You may use it to rest, eat, drink water or simply recharge before returning to your position.</li><li>Bring your <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">pre-packed food</span>, or you can buy food at the event.</li><li>Please, bring your <span style=\"color: rgb(51, 59, 63); font-weight: 700;\">water bottle.</span> There will be taps with drinking water available for refilling. Let\'s avoid using disposable plastic, <span style=\"color: rgb(51, 59, 63); font-weight: 700;\">help save the planet! :)<br></span></li></ul><p><span data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Attendance &amp; Conduct</span><font color=\"#333b3f\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"></span></font></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 59, 63); font-weight: 700;\">No-show without justification</span>, or&nbsp; cancellation on the event day, may affect your participation in future events :(</li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 59, 63); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(141, 148, 152); font-weight: 400;\">Maintain </span>professional communication</span>, follow instructions from supervisors, and stay in your assigned area unless told otherwise.</li></ul>', 'https://chat.whatsapp.com/FBjqPwVN9Z9AwNAjBePLMz?mode=gi_t', 0, 1, 1, 1, '2026-07-04 09:38:36', '2026-07-11 00:00:04'),
(20, 'Storage Lucan', 'a-Professional-House-Cleaner-980x653.webp', NULL, '2026-07-01', '2026-12-31', NULL, NULL, 'Wm O\'Brien Self Storage Lucan, Dublin, Newcastle Road, Adamstown, Lucan, Dublin, Irlanda', '53.3327422', '-6.458253699999999', NULL, 'Wm O\'Brien Self Storage Lucan, Dublin, Newcastle Road, Adamstown, Lucan, Dublin, Irlanda', '53.3327422', '-6.458253699999999', 'Wm O\'Brien Storage', 'Cleaner', 2, 0, 15.40, 'Responsible for cleaning and maintaining a two floor storage facility in Lucan.', '<p></p><li><p><strong style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">€15.40/hour</strong> (this is a <strong style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">registered job</strong>).</p></li><li><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>No transport provided</strong> </span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>Shift starts at 9:00/10:00am</strong> at the location.</span></p></li><p></p>', '<p>- Cleaning the full storage area across two floors</p><p>- Cleaning the bathroom&nbsp;and maintaining hygiene standards</p><p>- Cleaning doors&nbsp;throughout the facility<br></p><p>- Cleaning the stairs and lift<br></p><p>- Monitoring cleaning products stock (notify the KÓR team&nbsp;when supplies need replenishment)</p>', '<p>This position is based in Storage Lucan and requires reliability, organisation and the ability to work independently. The cleaner will ensure the facility remains presentable and safe for daily operations. Communication with the Kór team is important, especially regarding stock levels of cleaning materials. </p>', 'https://chat.whatsapp.com/DAeOdwRBMznLandxFJcIEL', 0, 1, 0, 1, '2026-07-09 14:27:44', '2026-08-09 16:14:38'),
(21, 'Dublin Horse Show', 'Captura-de-tela-2026-07-09-193627.png', NULL, '2026-08-04', '2026-08-09', NULL, NULL, 'RDS Venue - Anglesea Gate, Anglesea Road, Dublin 4, Irlanda', '53.3273228', '-6.2306883', NULL, 'RDS Venue - Anglesea Gate, Anglesea Road, Dublin 4, Irlanda', '53.3273228', '-6.2306883', '- Meeting point at the event location.\r\n\r\n- Please don’t be late!\r\nTraffic is already heavy in the area due to horses and trucks moving around for the event', 'Seller', 10, 0, 15.40, 'One of the most prestigious and long-standing events in the equestrian and social calendar, proudly hosted by the RDS in Dublin for over 150 years. Not only a highlight for horse lovers, but also a fantastic day out for the whole family.', '<ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">€15.40/hour</span> (this is a <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">registered job)</span>.</li><li><strong>What to wear:</strong> Black trousers and black (comfortable) shoes. You’ll get the event t-shirt.</li></ul>', '<p>We’ll be selling <strong>Horse Show programmes </strong>and<strong> catalogues</strong></p><p>Payments can be made by card or cash. If you have a calculator and prefer using one, feel free to bring it!</p>', '<p>The <strong>Gallagher Dublin Horse Show</strong> is one of the largest and most traditional equestrian events in Ireland, attracting national and international visitors.&nbsp;</p><p>You will be working directly with the public in a high flow environment, providing information and selling official programmes and catalogues.</p>', 'https://chat.whatsapp.com/J0iQqRFEE8T7Ceih4uulI8', 0, 1, 1, 1, '2026-07-09 19:38:52', '2026-08-10 00:00:04'),
(22, 'Luke Combs', 'download.jpg', NULL, '2026-07-18', '2026-07-19', NULL, NULL, 'Slane Castle, Slanecastle Demesne, Slane, Co. Meath, Irlanda', '53.7095833', '-6.561443', NULL, 'Br an Phoirt Thoir, stop 7623, North Wall, Dublin 1, Irlanda', '53.3469008', '-6.229429300000001', '- Meeting address: https://maps.app.goo.gl/HWNnjQoJmbVNL6HX8\r\n\r\n- Meeting time: 7:30am on Saturday\r\n\r\n- Bus returns to Dublin on Monday morning around 8am to the same meeting point.', 'Bar Staff', 40, 1, 15.40, 'Global country superstar Luke Combs brings his \"My Kinda Saturday Night Tour\" to the iconic Slane Castle next summer for what promises to be an unforgettable night under the Irish sky.', '<ul><li>The event is <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">outside Dublin</span>.</li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">€15.40/hour</span> (this is a <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">registered job)</span>.</li><li>You must be <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">available for all 2 days</span>.</li><li>We’ll be <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">camping on-site</span> for the weekend, you must bring your <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">own tent, mattress and sleeping bag</span>.</li><li>Shower facilities will be available in the <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">staff camping area</span>.</li><li><strong>This is a client event, not organizer by us.</strong></li></ul>', '<ul><li>We will all be working as part of the <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">bar team.</span></li><li>During the event, staff can be assigned to different bar positions, each supporting the service and helping the team run smoothly:<ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 59, 63);\">Tills:</span> Operating the cash register, taking orders, charging customers, and keeping the queue moving smoothly</li><li><span style=\"f