t-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">4 hours.</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#444444;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Your hourly rate will always be at or above the National Minimum Wage. The exact rate will be confirmed before each event.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left:0pt;\" align=\"left\"><table style=\"border:none;border-collapse:collapse;\"><colgroup><col width=\"107\"><col width=\"536\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td style=\"border-bottom:solid #dddddd 0.5pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#e6f1fb;padding:4pt 6pt 4pt 6pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#0c447c;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Payment</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:solid #dddddd 0.5pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#f8f8f8;padding:5pt 6pt 5pt 8pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Will I receive a payslip?</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-left:solid #c9a84c 1pt;border-right:solid #c9a84c 1pt;border-bottom:solid #dddddd 0.5pt;border-top:solid #dddddd 0.5pt;vertical-align:top;background-color:#ffffff;padding:5pt 8pt 6pt 10pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#444444;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Yes. Payslips are issued weekly and will show your gross pay, deductions (USC, PRSI, income tax where applicable) and net pay received. If you have not received yours, contact team@korprojectmanagement.ie.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></p><p><br></p>', 1, '2026-04-06 12:59:06', '2026-05-28 09:29:24');
