(99, '99', 'Victor', 'Norberto', 'victorhugonorberto@gmail.com', NULL, '$2y$12$TMIsFjWpLhxM4jro.oRl6Ox7EggKDEfhbotQpL4cUTiHNt8g0XpxC', '831120008', '353831120008', '353', 'IE', 'Male', '1999-11-13', 'Non-EU', 12, '9,4,2,7,10,3,13,8,11', 'My name is Victor, I am 26 years old, and I currently live in Phibsborough, Dublin, Ireland. I graduated in Nutrition in Brazil before deciding to move abroad in search of new experiences and personal growth.\r\n\r\nBefore moving to Ireland, I lived in London for two years, where I had the opportunity to work in different roles, improve my English, and adapt to a multicultural environment. These experiences helped me become more independent, resilient, and confident.\r\n\r\nSince moving to Dublin, I have continued building my professional experience through delivery services, events, hospitality, catering, customer service, and warehouse operations. I enjoy working with people, learning new skills, and taking on new challenges. Living abroad has taught me to adapt quickly, work hard, and make the most of every opportunity while continuously growing both personally and professionally.', 'I have worked with you before', 'Fully flexible', 'IMG_4541.jpeg', 'Victor_Norberto_B_CV.pdf', '0522252JB', NULL, 2, 3, '99GNIB.pdf', NULL, '2027-01-06', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 'c-9Xo5VKyuaWrW3X4V3bVH:APA91bFpnrUHmnjoOZckhcxVdavK86oC_LekwpfX1h38yji2vC7ONvnHxIT2_GLxznUCpcFT4dqN6AZ385nsYxmMUnPXuvMnd6O3fnQce4UQYtxlr6W5lwU', 1, '2026-06-22 09:32:51', '2026-08-11 20:10:04'),
(100, '100', 'Thanakorn', 'Pansila', 'Thanakorn_21-08@hotmail.com', NULL, '$2y$12$XxhZ52Lnk5hQAa0PQSDKnOtyxs//HUlC3lB1BToZ.ob0ix011jZse', '857127227', '353857127227', '353', 'IE', 'Male', '2000-08-21', 'Non-EU', 12, '10,13,12,8,11', 'Waiter\r\nFull Moon Thai Restaurant in Dublin\r\n• Provided exceptional table service in a high-volume restaurant environment\r\n• Managed food and beverage orders accurately and efficiently\r\n• Assisted customers with menu recommendations and handled special dietary\r\nrequests\r\n• Cleaned and prepared tables promptly for incoming guests\r\n• Restocked beverages and organized supplies for upcoming shifts\r\n• Ensured the service area was sanitized and organized during closing\r\n\r\nWaiter\r\nVida’s Thai Food in Alaska, United States\r\n• Served food and beverages efficiently in a fast-paced environment\r\n• Handled multiple tables simultaneously while maintaining a friendly and\r\nprofessional attitude\r\n• Delivered quick and high-quality service during peak dining hours\r\n\r\nDishwasher\r\nLand’s End Resort & Restaurant in Alaska, United States\r\n• Managed high-volume dishwashing and kitchen sanitation according to safety\r\nstandards\r\n• Organized and distributed clean equipment and tableware to designated kitchen\r\nareas\r\n• Executed deep-cleaning of kitchen equipment and workstations during closing\r\nprocedures\r\n\r\nHousekeeping Assistant\r\nLand’s End Resort & Restaurant in Alaska, United States\r\n• Restored rooms to pristine condition via deep cleaning, hoovering, and\r\ndisinfection\r\n• Replenished guest amenities and essential supplies for seamless room turnovers\r\n• Optimised room presentation by restocking refreshments and perfecting item\r\nplacement\r\n• Reported maintenance and safety hazards promptly to the Supervisor', 'Referral / Friend / Colleague', 'Weekdays,Weekends,Evening shifts,Day shifts,Fully flexible', 'Irish_Visa-Photo-2.jpeg', NULL, '0505953TB', NULL, 2, 5, 'IRP-Card---Thanakorn.P.pdf', 'PPS.pdf', '2026-11-11', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-22 09:43:09', '2026-06-22 12:16:06'),
