(425, '425', 'Larissa Agnes', 'Porto', 'larissa9porto@gnail.com', NULL, '$2y$12$B9OiTpEI3xB3hdHST8fZt.y42PWeN0XIBJ1Z8.ln9L9NSNn3pK5WK', '67992741078', '5567992741078', '55', 'BR', 'Female', '1992-11-08', 'Non-EU', 12, '9,4,2,10,3,13,12,8,11', 'I have extensive professional experience in both Ireland and Brazil, working in hospitality, customer service, food and beverage, professional cleaning, sports, childcare, elderly care, and event management.\r\n\r\nI currently work in the breakfast restaurant of a five-star hotel in Dublin, where I welcome guests, take orders, serve food and beverages, prepare and organize the restaurant before service, polish cutlery, plates, cups, and glassware, set up tables, and ensure an excellent dining experience by delivering high-quality customer service.\r\n\r\nI also worked in a café, where I prepared sandwiches and light meals, took orders, served food and drinks, cleaned and organized tables, and supported the daily operations of the business.\r\n\r\nIn addition, I have experience as a housekeeper in Ireland, working in corporate offices, including an accounting firm, maintaining high standards of cleanliness, hygiene, organization, and attention to detail.\r\n\r\nI have strong experience in customer service and event management, including welcoming guests, registration, event organization, and operational support.\r\n\r\nI hold a degree in Physical Education and have worked as a personal trainer. I also spent seven years working with children and adults with disabilities, including individuals with Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD). In addition, I taught swimming lessons to both autistic and neurotypical children, adapting each lesson to meet their individual needs.\r\n\r\nI have extensive experience caring for newborn babies, children, adults, and elderly people, always providing care with responsibility, empathy, patience, and dedication.\r\n\r\nI am a responsible, punctual, organized, and proactive professional. I learn quickly, work well in a team, adapt easily to new environments, and pay close attention to detail. I am committed to delivering excellent service and continuously improving my skills while contributing positively to every workplace.', 'Referral / Friend / Colleague', 'Fully flexible', '1784223605IMG_8695.jpeg', '1784223605_cv_Larissa---CV-High-Standard-Hotels-10KB.pdf', '0476967BB', NULL, 3, 4, '1784223605_permission1_IRL-Front---Larissa.heic', '1784223605_permission2_IRL-Back---Larissa.heic', '2026-10-18', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-07-16 18:40:05', '2026-07-16 18:40:05'),
